---
eleventyNavigation:
  parent: Home
  key: Playground
  order: 3
  excerpt: Edit a three-file Eleventy project and watch it build, without installing anything.
searchTitle: Playground
# The editors and previews want the full width
excludePageToc: true
---
<script type="module" src="/js/browser-window.js" webc:keep></script>

<h1>Playground</h1>
<p>This is a real Eleventy build, running in this page. Edit any of the three files below and watch the output update—change the <code>title</code> in front matter on a blog post and the list on the index page follows.</p>

<is-land on:visible import="/js/eleventy-editor.js">
	<div class="editor-layout">
		<p class="editor-filename"><code>index.md</code></p>
		<p class="editor-filename"><code>_site/index.html</code></p>
		<eleventy-editor focus group="try" output="external" data-editor-filename="index.md">
			<syntax-highlight language="liquid" :copy-button-enabled="false">---
subject: World
---
# Hello {{ subject }}

You can type here!

- [Markdown](/docs/languages/markdown/)
- [Liquid](/docs/languages/liquid/)

## Posts

{%- for post in collections.posts %}
- [{{ post.data.title }}]({{ post.url}})
{%- endfor %}

_Built with {{ eleventy.generator }}_</syntax-highlight>
		</eleventy-editor>
		<browser-window fill url="/"><eleventy-output group="try" data-editor-filename="index.md"></eleventy-output></browser-window>

		<p class="editor-filename"><code>post1.md</code></p>
		<p class="editor-filename"><code>_site/post1/index.html</code></p>
		<eleventy-editor group="try" output="external" data-editor-filename="post1.md">
			<syntax-highlight language="liquid" :copy-button-enabled="false">---
title: First blog post ⬅️
tags: posts
---
# {{ title }}</syntax-highlight>
		</eleventy-editor>
		<browser-window fill url="/post1/"><eleventy-output group="try" data-editor-filename="post1.md"></eleventy-output></browser-window>

		<p class="editor-filename"><code>post2.md</code></p>
		<p class="editor-filename"><code>_site/post2/index.html</code></p>
		<eleventy-editor group="try" output="external" data-editor-filename="post2.md">
			<syntax-highlight language="liquid" :copy-button-enabled="false">---
title: Second blog post
tags: posts
---
# {{ title }}</syntax-highlight>
		</eleventy-editor>
		<browser-window fill url="/post2/"><eleventy-output group="try" data-editor-filename="post2.md"></eleventy-output></browser-window>

		<h2 class="editor-layout-span">Build output</h2>
		<browser-window fill flush mode="dark" class="editor-layout-span"><eleventy-build-output group="try"></eleventy-build-output></browser-window>
	</div>
</is-land>
